 # Changelog — MedicK's Terrible Tooltips
 
-## v3.1.0-dev (unreleased) — D2 probe
-- Added an off-by-default probe that clones one native Image pill onto one affix line.
-- Added All / GreaterOnly probe targeting and the ruled `#C990FF` greater-affix tint preference.
-- Added fail-loud hierarchy/donor diagnostics with reversible margin and pooled-tooltip cleanup.
+## v3.1.0-dev (unreleased)
+- Added the ruled `#C990FF` greater-affix tint for Tier 6/7 affix sentences; T1–T5 stay game-default white.
+- Made the plain-text `Tier N·grade` signal the default while retaining Badge as an option.
+- Reduced the filter rule number to 120% and made it bold.
+- Dimmed sealed labels and composer-owned Alt/pinned detail rows to 90%.
+- Included the D2 native-pill probe, off by default, with All / GreaterOnly targeting.
+- Removed the unused badge text-colour helper.
 
 ## v3.0.2 — the Nexus bug-report release
 - Fixed Kaazkulaas's two-stat/weaver affix report by resolving `AffixFormatter`'s null affix from the stat property; each stat line intentionally carries its own bracket (for example, two clean `[1F]` lines).
